### Musician session (Jorge, profile 1, band 1) - JWT for the calls below
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU" }

> {% client.global.set("musician", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Non-musician login (jwt.gate has no musician profile)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Creative ratings without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings

### Creative ratings for rehearsal 1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}

### Rate a bandmate (Marco, profile 3) 1..5 - rater comes from the JWT; 409 on a second rating
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rateeProfileId": 3, "score": 4 }

### Rating yourself is 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rateeProfileId": 1, "score": 5 }

### Score outside 1..5 is 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rateeProfileId": 2, "score": 9 }

### An account without a musician profile is 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions/1/creative-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rateeProfileId": 3, "score": 4 }

### Start my set at concert 1 (409 if already started)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts/1/set-checkins/start
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "setStartedAt": "2026-06-14T21:00:00" }

### End my set - minutes played are capped at concert.show_minutes (409 if already ended)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts/1/set-checkins/end
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "setEndedAt": "2026-06-14T21:50:00" }

### Set check-ins for concert 1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/concerts/1/set-checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}

### Closing an already closed cycle returns the stored snapshot (200, unchanged)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
